abstract: >-
  The Reading Pack Format Specification, tool-neutral Production Standard,
  and an offline-first Python reference implementation for creating
  deterministic, human-reviewed book guides without reproducing manuscripts.
  The software is MIT-licensed; specifications and documentation are CC BY 4.0.
